		"descriptorContents": "# The build descriptor Zerops reads from the repository root. A contract application authors only `setup`,\n# `build.base`, `build.os` and an SPA's `build.buildCommands`: the platform generates the rest of the build (install,\n# tests, the checker, the type check), the deploy gate and the whole run section — the start script runs\n# `fabrika db migrate`, `fabrika db codegen --verify` and `fabrika db test-isolation` before the server, and the\n# crontab runs `fabrika job run purge` (ADR-0043). Any other key is refused at build.\n#\n# `setup` is the runtime's hostname, which `zeropsSetup` in fabrika.config.ts selects. The SPA commands run first and\n# write `dist/web`, which the contract's `site` mount serves.\n\nzerops:\n  - setup: notesapi\n    build:\n      base: alpine/bun@1.3\n      buildCommands:\n        - bun install --frozen-lockfile\n        - bun run build:web\n",
		"descriptorSha256": "be1c32fc6a36ec0c983e0de54fd079b67dfe81618cfe81a22d019107d58dfb27",
